-- working day: a Saturday, a Sunday, Christmas Day, Good Friday, a bank holiday are not; a Tuesday, Christmas Eve are
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 7 4 2026) `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 4 4 2026) `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 5 4 2026) `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 3 4 2026) `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 6 4 2026) `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 25 12 2026) EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 24 12 2026) EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 64B the day is a working day` (Date 3 4 2026) EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS TRUE
-- the third working day after Thursday 2 April 2026: with Good Friday and Easter Monday out, Tuesday 7, Wednesday 8, Thursday 9 April; with neither out, Friday 3, Monday 6, Tuesday 7 April
#ASSERT `reg 64B the nth working day after the day` (Date 2 4 2026) 3 `reg 64A test the Good Fridays in the tests` `reg 64A test the bank holidays in the tests` EQUALS Date 9 4 2026
#ASSERT `reg 64B the nth working day after the day` (Date 2 4 2026) 3 EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS Date 7 4 2026
#ASSERT `reg 64B the nth working day after the day` (Date 2 4 2026) 0 EMPTY EMPTY EQUALS Date 2 4 2026

